@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@adminToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Métricas de Rendimiento Académico (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/academic-performance
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Métricas de Rezago y Riesgo Académico (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/retention-risk
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Métricas Agregadas de Asistencia por Grupo (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/attendance
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Tendencias Temáticas de Consultas IA (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/chat-topics
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### Métricas de Satisfacción de Cuestionarios (Admin / Analyst)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics/satisfaction?kind=ONBOARDING
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

